  "term": "Stigma Impact Scale",
  "definition": "The Stigma Impact Scale is a questionnaire used to explore how stigma is experienced and perceived by a person. In the source, it was used to examine perceived stigma in people with dementia, including feelings of being devalued, others’ negative reactions, and changes in relationships.",
